'''List of Shikinaisha in Sanuki Province''' (Sanuki no Shikinaisha Ichiran) is a list of {{ill|shrine|shrine|shrine|神社|神社|shrine|shrine}}s in {{ill|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|讃岐国|讃岐国|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province}} recorded in volumes 9 and 10, “Kamimyōchō, Upper and Lower”, of the {{ill|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki}} and {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|延喜式神名帳|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|延喜式神名帳|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|Engishiki Jinmyōchō}}, including shrines known as {{ill|Shikinaisha|Shikinaisha|Shikinaisha|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|式内社|Shikinaisha|Shikinaisha}} and their {{ill|Candidate shrine|Candidate shrine|Candidate shrine|論社|論社|Candidate shrine|Candidate shrine}}, which are classified under {{ill|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|讃岐国|讃岐国|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province}}.
It also includes shrines known as {{ill|Shikigai‐sha|Shikigai‐sha|Shikigai‐sha|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|式外社|Shikigai‐sha|Shikigai‐sha}} that existed at the time the ‘Engishiki’ shrine catalogue was compiled but were not recorded in it.
== Shikinaisha == In the ‘Engishiki’ shrine catalogue, three groups of major shrines (3 shrines) and 21 groups of minor shrines (21 shrines), a total of 24 shrines, are recorded.
