'''讃岐国の式内社一覧'''（さぬきのくにのしきないしゃいちらん）は、『[[Engishiki]]』第9巻・第10巻「神名帳上下」（[[延喜式神名帳]]）に記載のある[[神社]]、いわゆる「[[式内社]]」およびその[[論社]]のうち、[[讃岐国]]に分類されている神社の一覧。
また『延喜式』神名帳の編纂当時に存在したが同帳に記載の無い神社、いわゆる「[[式外社]]」についても付記する。
({{ill|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle}}) 05:35, 31 March 2025 (UTC)}} {{ill|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle}} ({{ill|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle}}) 09:49, 26 March 2025 (UTC)}} – {{ill|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle|User:Immanuelle}} ({{ill|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle}}) 09:48, 26 March 2025 (UTC)}} ({{ill|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle}}) 05:01, 18 March 2025 (UTC)}} ({{ill|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle|User talk:Immanuelle}}) 05:34, 17 March 2025 (UTC)}}
'''List of Shikinaisha in Sanuki Province''' (Sanuki no Shikinaisha Ichiran) is a list of {{ill|shrine|shrine|shrine|神社|神社|shrine|shrine|12=draft}}s in {{ill|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|讃岐国|讃岐国|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|12=draft}} recorded in volumes 9 and 10, “Kamimyōchō, Upper and Lower”, of the {{ill|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|Engishiki|12=draft}} and {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|延喜式神名帳|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|延喜式神名帳|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|12=draft}}, including shrines known as {{ill|Shikinaisha|Shikinaisha|Shikinaisha|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|式内社|Shikinaisha|Shikinaisha|12=draft}} and their {{ill|Candidate shrine|Candidate shrine|Candidate shrine|論社|論社|Candidate shrine|Candidate shrine|12=draft}}, which are classified under {{ill|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|讃岐国|讃岐国|Sanuki Province|Sanuki Province|12=draft}}.
It also includes shrines known as {{ill|Shikigai‐sha|Shikigai‐sha|Shikigai‐sha|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|式外社|Shikigai‐sha|Shikigai‐sha|12=draft}} that existed at the time the ‘Engishiki’ shrine catalogue was compiled but were not recorded in it.
--><!-- The subsequent tables are translated following the same principles with appropriate conversion of internal links and table headings. -->

This is a '''List of Shikinaisha in Sanuki Province'''. Or the list of shrines in [[Sanuki Province]] which is present in the {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|ja|延喜式神名帳|12=draft}}. On this page we will also cover the {{ill|Shikigeisha|ja|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|12=draft}} of [[Sanuki Province]] which are shrines that are known to have existed at that time due to other historical records, such as the [[Rikkokushi]], but for some reason were excluded from the {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|ja|延喜式神名帳|12=draft}}. We will cover them in a separate list to avoid confusion.
== Shikinai Shrines (式内社) == In the ‘Engishiki’ shrine catalogue, three groups of major shrines (3 shrines) and 21 groups of minor shrines (21 shrines), a total of 24 shrines, are recorded.
